    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Jump is a British television series that follows celebrities as they try to master various winter sports including skeleton, bobsleigh, snowskates, ski cross, and giant slalom. Davina McCall and Alex Brooker presented the first series, with McCall returning for future series. Brooker did not return for future series however. Winter Olympic skier Graham Bell and skeleton gold medallist Amy Williams put the celebrities through training in the UK and Austria. Britain's first Olympic ski jumper, Eddie \"The Eagle\" Edwards, appears live on the show to demonstrate the ski jump.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
